//  Direction of travel: EAST → WEST  (upstream → downstream)
//  PM increases eastward:  PM 13.98 (LA TUNA CANYON) ←── PM 29.88 (ROSEMEAD)
//  Corridor length: ~16 miles, 25 ML sensors, 22 OR sensors, 18 FR sensors
//
//  Data source: station_map.csv (194 rows total, I-210 W subset = 77 stations)
//  Baseline: avg of Dec 3, 10, 17 (normal Tuesday)
//  Fire day: Jan 7, 2025 (Eaton Fire ignition ~6:18 PM PST)
